    "content": "**Hello! Could you tell us a bit about yourself?**\n\nHello. My name is Shinenbayar Gansukh, and I work as a Senior Developer. I am responsible for the software side of the project I oversee, and I prepare my team members' work plans and the technical solutions.\n\n**Why did you join AILab?**\n\nThe opportunities for growth and the strong support from management, but what influenced me most was the chance to work alongside peers my own age.\n\n**The advantages of working at AILab**\n\nThe company always offers every kind of support for taking initiative and provides more flexible working arrangements.\n\n**What are you focusing on these days?**\n\nTo improve development quality, I am focused on introducing a variety of testing methodologies into my project.\n\n**What does a typical workday look like for you?**\n\nI start my morning with a hot coffee and begin work with our Daily Stand Up. In the morning hours I focus on new technologies and research, and in the afternoon I dedicate myself fully to development.\n\n**What do you enjoy doing in your free time, outside of work?**\n\nI enjoy playing various sports and exploring new experiences.\n\n**What are your dreams and goals?**\n\nI aim to become a skilled professional who has made a clear contribution of my own to my country.\n\nYou have just met Senior Developer G. Shinenbayar. See you soon in the next edition!",
